# ===== ABOUT PAGE =====
#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:16
msgid ""
"Rissala : la plateforme de référence en sciences islamiques, langue arabe et "
"finance islamique"
msgstr ""
"Rissala: the reference platform in Islamic sciences, Arabic language and "
"Islamic finance"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:18
msgid ""
"Rissala est une plateforme éducative dédiée à l'étude rigoureuse des "
"sciences islamiques, à l'apprentissage de la langue arabe et à la "
"compréhension de la finance islamique. Disponible en français, en anglais et "
"en arabe, elle rend accessibles des connaissances authentiques, vérifiées et "
"structurées, fondées sur le Coran, la Sunna et les avis des savants "
"classiques et contemporains."
msgstr ""
"Rissala is an educational platform dedicated to the rigorous study of "
"Islamic sciences, learning the Arabic language, and understanding Islamic "
"finance. Available in French, English, and Arabic, it provides access to "
"authentic, verified, and structured knowledge based on the Quran, the "
"Sunnah, and the opinions of classical and contemporary scholars."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:27
msgid "Ce que nous enseignons"
msgstr "What we teach"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:34
msgid "Fiqh (jurisprudence islamique)"
msgstr "Fiqh (Islamic jurisprudence)"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:37
msgid ""
"Comparaison des quatre écoles juridiques (madhabs) : hanafite, malikite, "
"chaféite, hanbalite."
msgstr ""
"Comparison of the four schools of jurisprudence (madhabs): Hanafi, Maliki, "
"Shafi'i, Hanbali."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:44
msgid "Hadith et sciences du hadith"
msgstr "Hadith and sciences of hadith"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:47
msgid "Authentification, chaînes de transmission (isnad), classification."
msgstr "Authentication, chains of transmission (isnad), classification."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:54
msgid "Tafsir (exégèse coranique)"
msgstr "Tafsir (Quranic exegesis)"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:57
msgid "Interprétation classique et contemporaine du Coran."
msgstr "Classical and contemporary interpretation of the Quran."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:64
msgid "Aqida (croyance islamique)"
msgstr "Aqida (Islamic belief)"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:67
msgid "Fondements de la foi selon Ahl al-Sunna."
msgstr "Foundations of faith according to Ahl al-Sunnah."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:74
msgid "Sîra (biographie du Prophète ﷺ)"
msgstr "Sirah (biography of the Prophet ﷺ)"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:77
msgid "Vie, contexte historique et enseignements."
msgstr "Life, historical context, and teachings."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:87
msgid ""
"Grammaire (nahw), conjugaison (sarf), vocabulaire coranique, arabe classique "
"et moderne."
msgstr ""
"Grammar (nahw), conjugation (sarf), Quranic vocabulary, classical and modern "
"Arabic."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:97
msgid ""
"Principes de la charia économique, contrats halal, alternatives à la banque "
"conventionnelle, zakat, investissement conforme."
msgstr ""
"Principles of economic Sharia, halal contracts, alternatives to conventional "
"banking, zakat, compliant investment."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:106
msgid "Notre approche"
msgstr "Our approach"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:109
msgid ""
"Chaque contenu publié sur Rissala repose sur des sources primaires — Coran, "
"Sunna authentifiée — et sur les positions établies des écoles juridiques "
"reconnues, avec citation systématique des références. Notre méthodologie "
"privilégie la traçabilité des sources à l'opinion non sourcée."
msgstr ""
"Every content published on Rissala is based on primary sources — Quran, "
"authenticated Sunnah — and the established positions of recognized legal "
"schools, with systematic citation of references. Our methodology prioritizes "
"traceability of sources over unsourced opinion."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:116
msgid "À qui s'adresse Rissala"
msgstr "Who is Rissala for"

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:119
msgid ""
"Rissala s'adresse aux nouveaux musulmans, aux étudiants en sciences "
"islamiques, aux personnes en apprentissage de la langue arabe, et à toute "
"personne souhaitant structurer sa compréhension de l'islam ou des principes "
"de la finance islamique — en français, en anglais ou en arabe."
msgstr ""
"Rissala is for new Muslims, students of Islamic sciences, people learning "
"the Arabic language, and anyone wishing to structure their understanding of "
"Islam or the principles of Islamic finance — in French, English, or Arabic."

#: .\templates\core\legal\about.html:120
msgid ""
"Rissala est pensée pour une audience internationale : chaque version "
